<graph edgedefault="undirected"><node id="Reserve Bank of India">
  <data key="d0">Reserve Bank of India</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The central bank of India responsible for regulating the monetary policy and banking operations in the country.&lt;SEP&gt;The Reserve Bank of India is the central bank of India, responsible for issuing directives on interest rates and overseeing the banking sector's conduct regarding deposit accounts.&lt;SEP&gt;The central banking institution of India that regulates the issue and supply of the Indian rupee and oversees monetary policy.&lt;SEP&gt;The central banking institution of India, responsible for regulating the country's monetary policy and overseeing the banking system.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-574eef8b2a231a2171cb4eadad4c29e5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-008</data>
