<node id="Banking Regulation Act, 1949">
  <data key="d0">Banking Regulation Act, 1949</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">The Banking Regulation Act, 1949 is a legislative framework that governs the banking sector in India, outlining the rights of depositors and the regulations that banks must follow.</data>
