<node id="Bank">
  <data key="d0">Bank</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">A financial institution offering various deposit products and banking services.&lt;SEP&gt;Financial institution that accepts deposits from customers and offers interest on those deposits in various accounts.&lt;SEP&gt;The financial institution managing the deposit accounts and responsible for the nomination process and customer service policies.&lt;SEP&gt;An organization offering various banking products and services, including but not limited to debit cards, mobile banking, internet banking, and ATM access.&lt;SEP&gt;The financial institution responsible for managing term deposits, paying interest, and enforcing policies regarding depositors, particularly in the context of deceased account holders.&lt;SEP&gt;A financial institution offering banking services and products to customers, including account management, deposit collections, and financial literacy support.&lt;SEP&gt;Bank refers to the financial institution providing services such as accepting deposits, offering loans, and other financial services to individuals and businesses.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-008</data>
  <data key="d4">Deposit Policy.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1787057501</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
