  <data key="d1">other</data>
  <data key="d2">A form of demand deposit allowing unlimited withdrawals, subject to account balance.&lt;SEP&gt;A type of bank account that is used for frequent transactions, typically by businesses or individuals requiring regular access to funds.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6e9c97657e05cf315dfdf575fb8d6364-chunk-003</data>
